[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3367931272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111229#issuecomment-3367931272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111229","id":3367931272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ivo2I","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-04T05:49:23Z","updated_at":"2025-10-04T05:49:23Z","body":"Well, this led me down a rabbit hole. \r\n\r\nI don't think we should go for this quick fix. The code needs to be rewritten. Even with this change we will run into issues when we need mipmaps on the color buffer, but `check_backbuffer()` was called before `_create_render_target_backbuffer()`. \r\n\r\nWe shouldn't have two completely different implementations of `check_backbuffer()` that do almost the same thing. And then two different paths for creating the `rt->backbuffer_fbo` and the `rt->backbuffer`. \r\n\r\nThe core problem is that the needs of 2D and 3D are slightly different. For some reason the code currently tries to share the backbuffer as much as possible between 2D and 3D. I think the best approach would be to just remove `TextureStorage::check_backbuffer()`entirely and use `RenderSceneBuffersGLES3::check_backbuffer()` for 3D and `_create_render_target_backbuffer()` for 2D","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3367931272/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3367943683","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111229#issuecomment-3367943683","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111229","id":3367943683,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ivr4D","user":{"login":"Kaleb-Reid","id":78945904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4OTQ1OTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78945904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid","html_url":"https://github.com/Kaleb-Reid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-04T06:04:14Z","updated_at":"2025-10-04T06:04:14Z","body":"@clayjohn I was thinking maybe there was some kind of optimization reason for using ```TextureStorage::check_backbuffer()``` when possible, but given that must not be the 